  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dr.S.A.Syed Hafeezullah vs State Rep. By Its on 13 November, 2024 Author: P.Velmurugan Bench: P.Velmurugan Crl.O.P.N In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 13.11.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice P.Velmurugan Crl.O.P.No.26274 of 2024 and Crl.M.P.No.14590 and 14591 of 2024 Dr.S.A.Syed Hafeezullah S/o.Syed Sathar Proprietor, Supreme Labs (Marketer) No.175/72, J.J.Khan Road Royapettah, Chennai - 600 023 ... Petitione Vs. State rep. by its Food Safety Officer Area Code No.335 Kolathur Area, Chennai District No.33, West Jones Road Saidapet, Chennai - 600 013 ... Responde Prayer: Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 528 of B.N.S.S for the records relating to charge sheet and complaint in C.C.No.1470 th on the file of the learned X Metropolitan Magistrate, Egmore, Chennai quash the same as against this petitioner. 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Crl For Petitioner : Ms.R.Revathy For Respondent : Mr.S.Vinoth Kumar Dr.S.A.Syed Hafeezullah vs State Rep. By Its on 13 November, 2024",
    "facts": "This Criminal Original Petition has been filed by the petitioner to quash the charge sheet and complaint against the petitioner in C.C.No.1470 of 2024 on the file of the learned Xth Metropolitan Magistrate, Egmore, Chennai. 2. The case of the petitioner is that the petitioner is a practicing Doctor and he is also the Proprietor of an entity namely M/s.Supreme Labs which is marketing food supplements by name Supreme Labs Neutraceuticals-Health E Food Products. While so, the respondent has filed a complaint against the petitioner for the offence under Sections 51, 52(1), 53 and 59(i) of the Food Safety and Standard Act 2006 (hereinafter referred to as \"the Act\"), alleging that the samples taken from the petitioners premises did not meet the requirements of the Act and the same has been taken on file in C.C.No.1470 of https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis th 2024 on the file of the learned X Metropolitan Magistrate, Egmore, Chennai. Hence, the petitioner has filed the present petition to quash the same.",
    "arguments": "3. The learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner has not committed any offence as alleged by the prosecution.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. The learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner has not committed any offence as alleged by the prosecution.",
